# # /hali/
#
# Namespace of the hali ontology, https://w3id.org/hali#, and of the graph and
# media-type names that hali derives from it. hali is an open-source command-line
# tool that keeps a SKOS/OWL/SHACL description of local files:
# https://github.com/natemarks/hali
#
# https://w3id.org/hali           the ontology (Turtle on request; otherwise the project page)
# https://w3id.org/hali/...       any other name under it: the project page
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Nate Marks
# GitHub username: natemarks

RewriteEngine on

# Turtle: the core ontology.
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle
RewriteRule ^$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/natemarks/hali/main/src/ontology/core.ttl [R=303,L]

# Anything else, including browsers and clients that send */*.
RewriteRule ^$ https://github.com/natemarks/hali [R=303,L]

# Names under /hali/ (graph names, media types) are identifiers only.
RewriteRule ^.+$ https://github.com/natemarks/hali [R=302,L]
